  infoPanel: {fileID: 1924710915}
  infoText: {fileID: 930599887}
  fullText: 'Yu Kou Day: Offer a pig to Ancestor Bi Bing? Offer a pig to Ancestor
    Bi Ding? Offer a pig to Ancestor Bi Wu? Offer a piglet to Father Yi?

    (Bi
    refers to a deceased female royal ancestor; Father Yi is a deceased male royal
    ancestor. The inscription records a divination about which ancestors should receive
